% n30_numtype_undeclared -- `numtype` on a name that was never declared. The
% kernel looks the name up in the def table and rejects 21; nothing is
% nominated, so K[8] stays 0.
0 sort 0
axiom I64 : 0
numtype NotDeclared
1 const I64
2 sort 0
3 pi 1 2
axiom P : 3
4 const P
5 num 7
6 app 4 5
7 sort 0
check 6 : 7
